{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "unr", "source_text": "ನಮಸ್ಕಾರ", "target_text": "जोहार", "category": "greetings"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "unr", "source_text": "ಶುಭೋದಯ", "target_text": "बुगी सेताः", "category": "greetings"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "unr", "source_text": "ಧನ್ಯವಾದಗಳು", "target_text": "सराहव", "category": "courtesy"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "unr", "source_text": "ಪುಸ್ತಕವನ್ನು ತೆರೆಯಿರಿ.", "target_text": "होनको पुथी ओलोल पे।", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "unr", "source_text": "ಎದ್ದು ನಿಲ್ಲಿ.", "target_text": "तिंगु पे।", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "unr", "source_text": "ಕುಳಿತುಕೊಳ್ಳಿ.", "target_text": "दुबुङ पे।", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "unr", "source_text": "ಐದು ಸಂಖ್ಯೆಯನ್ನು ಬರೆಯಿರಿ.", "target_text": "मोड़े नंबर ओल पे।", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "unr", "source_text": "ವಸ್ತುಗಳನ್ನು ಎಣಿಸಿ.", "target_text": "चीज को लेखाए पे।", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "unr", "source_text": "ಚಿತ್ರವನ್ನು ನೋಡಿ.", "target_text": "मुरुत नेल पे।", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "unr", "source_text": "ಈ ಪದವನ್ನು ಓದಿ.", "target_text": "नेया कजी पड़ाव पे।", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "unr", "source_text": "ನನ್ನ ನಂತರ ಪುನರಾವರ್ತಿಸಿ.", "target_text": "ऐंग तायोम कजी पे।", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
{"source_lang": "kn", "target_lang": "unr", "source_text": "ಯಾರು ಉತ್ತರಿಸಬಹುದು?", "target_text": "ओकोए कजी दड़ेया?", "category": "classroom_instructions"}
